create issue

Usage:
  mdql issue add [flags]

Flags:
      --assignee string   person slug
      --body string       markdown body
  -h, --help              help for add
      --open              
      --points int        
      --priority string   low|medium|high
      --project string    project slug
      --tags strings      
      --title string      required

Global Flags:
  -f, --format string   output: table|json|csv|tsv
  -q, --quiet           IDs only
      --root string     store root (default ".")
